            "paragraph": "The model features segmented labour markets, partially mobile capital and logistic supply curves for land and water. It also incorporates GHG emissions, allowing for carbon taxes, emission caps and permit trade systems. Dynamics are driven by labour supply growth, capital accumulation and technological change, with a possibility to link labour productivity to research and development expenditure.",
